msgid "# HiSparse on Ascend"
msgstr "# 昇腾上的 HiSparse"

msgid "## Feature Introduction"
msgstr "## 特性介绍"

msgid "### Working Principle"
msgstr "### 工作原理"

msgid ""
"HiSparse keeps recent KV rows in the NPU Resident cache and uses the NPU Hot\n"
"cache for rows refilled from Host memory. The resolver checks the selected rows\n"
"against both NPU caches. Resident and Hot\n"
"hits can be read directly. For misses, HiSparse refills only the missing rows\n"
"from the Host KV mirror into Hot before attention runs. With speculative decoding,\n"
"the resolver considers the selected rows for all query tokens of a request\n"
"together before evicting Hot rows."
msgstr ""
"HiSparse 将最近的 KV 行保存在 NPU Resident 缓存中，并使用 NPU Hot 缓存存放从 Host "
"内存回填的行。解析器会针对两个 NPU 缓存检查所选中的行。Resident 和 Hot 命中可直接读取。对于未命中，HiSparse "
"会在注意力计算运行前，仅将缺失的行从 Host KV 镜像回填到 Hot。在使用投机解码时，解析器会在淘汰 Hot 行之前，统一考虑一个请求所有查询 "
"token 所选中的行。"

msgid "### Usage Scenarios"
msgstr "### 使用场景"

msgid "### Constraints and Limitations"
msgstr "### 约束与限制"

msgid "| Category | Constraint |"
msgstr "| 类别 | 约束 |"

msgid ""
"| Host storage | Use private Host pools per tensor-parallel rank and Core "
"eager Host mirroring. |"
msgstr "| Host 存储 | 每个张量并行 rank 使用独立的 Host 池，并采用 Core eager Host 镜像。 |"

msgid ""
"| TopK | The existing SFA requirement of divisibility by 128 applies. |"
msgstr "| TopK | 沿用现有 SFA 要求，即必须能被 128 整除。 |"

msgid ""
"| Feature mutual exclusion | HiSparse and "
"`additional_config.sparse_kv_offload_config.enabled` cannot be enabled "
"together. |"
msgstr ""
"| 特性互斥 | HiSparse 与 `additional_config.sparse_kv_offload_config.enabled` "
"不能同时启用。 |"

msgid "## Feature Usage"
msgstr "## 特性使用"

msgid "### Usage Example"
msgstr "### 使用示例"

msgid "### Verifying the Feature"
msgstr "### 验证特性"

msgid ""
"Send a request and check the server's metrics endpoint for the HiSparse miss\n"
"counter. The counter can stay at zero when selected rows are already on the NPU."
msgstr "发送一个请求，并在服务器的指标端点中查看 HiSparse 未命中计数器。当所选中的行已在 NPU 上时，该计数器可能保持为零。"

msgid "## Configuration Parameters"
msgstr "## 配置参数"

msgid ""
"| `hisparse_config` | Enables Core HiSparse for the supported sparse "
"Attention backend. |"
msgstr "| `hisparse_config` | 为支持的稀疏 Attention 后端启用 Core HiSparse。 |"

msgid ""
"| `eager_host_mirror` | Keep `true` for this foundation; Core maintains the "
"Host KV mirror. |"
msgstr "| `eager_host_mirror` | 在此基础版本中保持为 `true`；由 Core 维护 Host KV 镜像。 |"

msgid ""
"| `host_pool_gib` | Host pool size in GiB per tensor-parallel rank. Size it "
"for the planned context lengths and concurrency; the example reserves 4 GiB "
"per rank. |"
msgstr ""
"| `host_pool_gib` | 每个张量并行 rank 的 Host 池大小，单位为 GiB。请根据规划的上下文长度和并发量进行设置；示例中每个"
" rank 预留 4 GiB。 |"

msgid ""
"| `device_buffer_size` | Per-request Hot capacity in KV rows. It must hold "
"the deduplicated union of rows selected during speculative verification and "
"fit the resolver's on-chip UB budget. |"
msgstr ""
"| `device_buffer_size` | 每个请求的 Hot 容量，以 KV "
"行数计。它必须能容纳投机验证期间所选中的行的去重并集，并符合解析器的片上 UB 预算。 |"

msgid ""
"| `kv_cache_dtype` / `indexer_kv_dtype` | Select main and Indexer KV formats"
" independently from model-weight quantization. |"
msgstr ""
"| `kv_cache_dtype` / `indexer_kv_dtype` | 独立于模型权重量化，选择 Main 和 Indexer 的 KV "
"格式。 |"

msgid ""
"HiSparse keeps a Host mirror of sparse MLA KV rows and refills only the missing\n"
"rows selected by attention. This reduces the NPU cache capacity needed for long\n"
"contexts. The experimental Ascend backend supports A2/A3 through the arch22\n"
"resolver and 950PR&950DT Products through the SIMT resolver. 950PR&950DT Products require a SIMT-capable CANN 9.2\n"
"toolchain; build the custom operators for the target architecture."
msgstr ""
"HiSparse 在 Host 侧维护一份稀疏 MLA KV 行的镜像，仅回填由注意力机制选中的缺失行。这降低了长上下文所需的 NPU "
"缓存容量。实验性的昇腾后端通过 arch22 解析器支持 A2/A3，并通过 SIMT 解析器支持 Ascend "
"950PR&950DT系列产品。Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品需要支持 SIMT 的 CANN 9.2 "
"工具链；请针对目标架构构建自定义算子。"

msgid ""
"Use HiSparse with Model Runner V2 for sparse RoPE MLA/SFA models serving long\n"
"contexts. A2/A3 support INT8 C8 KV: Main KV stores INT8 values, BF16 RoPE and\n"
"FP32 scales; Indexer KV stores INT8 values with FP16 scales. 950PR&950DT Products retain BF16 KV\n"
"and native C8 (E4M3FN values with FP32 scales), with independent Main and\n"
"Indexer KV dtype selection. The A2/A3 extension does not add a BF16 HiSparse\n"
"serving path or change the existing non-HiSparse BF16 path."
msgstr ""
"对于服务长上下文的稀疏 RoPE MLA/SFA 模型，请将 HiSparse 与 Model Runner V2 配合使用。A2/A3 支持 INT8"
" C8 KV：Main KV 存储 INT8 值、BF16 RoPE 和 FP32 缩放因子；Indexer KV 存储 INT8 值及 FP16 "
"缩放因子。Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品保留 BF16 KV 和原生 C8（E4M3FN 值及 FP32 缩放因子），并支持独立选择 "
"Main 和 Indexer KV 的数据类型。A2/A3 扩展不会新增 BF16 HiSparse 服务路径，也不会改变现有的非 HiSparse "
"BF16 路径。"

msgid ""
"| Hardware and software | A2/A3 with the arch22 custom operators, or "
"950PR&950DT Products with a SIMT-capable CANN 9.2 toolchain. |"
msgstr ""
"| 硬件和软件 | 使用 arch22 自定义算子的 A2/A3，或使用支持 SIMT 的 CANN 9.2 工具链的 Ascend "
"950PR&950DT系列产品。 |"

msgid ""
"| Cache formats | A2/A3: INT8 C8. 950PR&950DT Products: BF16 or native "
"E4M3FN C8. C4 and TurboQuant are outside the current support scope. |"
msgstr ""
"| 缓存格式 | A2/A3：INT8 C8。Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品：BF16 或原生 E4M3FN C8。C4 和 "
"TurboQuant 不在当前支持范围内。 |"

msgid ""
"| Parallelism and transport | Supports PCP (prefill and decode request "
"sharding). DCP and external P/D transport are outside the current support "
"scope. |"
msgstr "| 并行与传输 | 支持 PCP（prefill 和 decode 请求分片）。DCP 和外部 P/D 传输不在当前支持范围内。 |"

msgid ""
"Set `MODEL_PATH` to a compatible sparse MLA model and start the server with\n"
"Model Runner V2. The following example uses BF16 KV on 950PR&950DT Products:"
msgstr ""
"将 `MODEL_PATH` 设置为兼容的稀疏 MLA 模型，并使用 Model Runner V2 启动服务器。以下示例在 Ascend "
"950PR&950DT系列产品上使用 BF16 KV："

msgid ""
"For native C8 on 950PR&950DT Products, replace the two dtype options with:"
msgstr "如需在 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品上使用原生 C8，请将这两个 dtype 选项替换为："

msgid ""
"For A2/A3 INT8 C8, use a compatible INT8 KV model and replace the two dtype\n"
"options with:"
msgstr "如需在 A2/A3 上使用 INT8 C8，请使用兼容的 INT8 KV 模型，并将这两个 dtype 选项替换为："

msgid ""
"These options select KV-cache quantization independently of model-weight\n"
"quantization; keep the weight-quantization options required by the model."
msgstr "这些选项独立于模型权重量化来选择 KV 缓存量化；请保留模型所需的权重量化选项。"

msgid ""
"On A3 with HDK 25.5.1, select MemFabric in the HiSparse connector to provide\n"
"AIV Host-memory mapping. The SDK must include the A3 AccOffload extension.\n"
"If the extension is missing, source the CANN environment and build it with\n"
"`mfcli kernel install --soc-version A3`."
msgstr ""
"在搭载 HDK 25.5.1 的 A3 上，请在 HiSparse connector 中选择 MemFabric，以提供\n"
"AIV Host 内存映射。SDK 必须包含 A3 AccOffload 扩展。\n"
"如果缺少该扩展，请先 source CANN 环境，然后使用\n"
"`mfcli kernel install --soc-version A3` 进行构建。"

msgid ""
"For a `MultiConnector` configuration, put `transfer_backend` in the\n"
"`HiSparseConnector` child's extra configuration. This setting selects\n"
"the private Host allocator. Omitting it uses native ACL Host-memory registration."
msgstr ""
"对于 `MultiConnector` 配置，请将 `transfer_backend` 放在\n"
"`HiSparseConnector` 子项的额外配置中。该设置用于选择\n"
"私有 Host 内存分配器。省略该设置时，将使用原生 ACL Host 内存注册。"

msgid ""
"On a single Ascend 950 node with colocated Prefill and Decode, you can\n"
"[combine HiSparse with AscendStore](#combining-hisparse-with-ascendstore)\n"
"to offload historical KV to local DDR and reuse full KV blocks from MemCache\n"
"across requests."
msgstr ""
"在单台昇腾 950 节点上以 Prefill 与 Decode 混部（colocated）方式运行时，你可以\n"
"[将 HiSparse 与 AscendStore 结合使用](#combining-hisparse-with-ascendstore)，\n"
"把历史 KV 卸载到本地 DDR，并跨请求复用来自 MemCache 的完整 KV 块。"

msgid "### Combining HiSparse with AscendStore"
msgstr "### 将 HiSparse 与 AscendStore 结合使用"

msgid ""
"AscendStore saves and restores Host Source and NPU Indexer pages. HiSparse\n"
"manages the Host Source, Resident, and Hot buffers."
msgstr ""
"AscendStore 负责保存和恢复 Host Source 与 NPU Indexer 页。HiSparse\n"
"则负责管理 Host Source、Resident 和 Hot 缓冲区。"

msgid ""
"Use the vLLM Core revision pinned by the matching vLLM Ascend build with\n"
"Ascend HiSparse support. Keep the attention options above and pass the following\n"
"JSON to `--kv-transfer-config`."
msgstr ""
"请使用与支持昇腾 HiSparse 的对应 vLLM Ascend 构建所固定的 vLLM Core 版本。\n"
"保留上述 attention 选项，并将以下 JSON 传给 `--kv-transfer-config`。"

msgid ""
"See [KV Cache Pool](kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md) for MemCache setup and\n"
"[AscendStore settings](#ascendstore-settings) for the required options.\n"
"See [Monitoring AscendStore prefix reuse](#monitoring-ascendstore-prefix-reuse)\n"
"for the metrics to check after startup.\n"
"Mooncake support is deferred pending a fix for\n"
"[PUT timeout data corruption](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/4491)."
msgstr ""
"MemCache 的配置请参见 [KV Cache Pool](kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md)，所需选项请参见\n"
"[AscendStore 配置](#ascendstore-settings)。\n"
"启动后需要检查的指标请参见[监控 AscendStore 前缀复用](#monitoring-ascendstore-prefix-reuse)。\n"
"Mooncake 支持暂缓，需等待\n"
"[PUT 超时数据损坏](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/4491)问题修复。"

msgid ""
"AscendStore keys for HiSparse use the `hisparse-ascendstore-v1` namespace.\n"
"This version identifies the external pool key format. The keys include the\n"
"target and draft checkpoint identities, resolved revisions, dummy-weight mode,\n"
"filename patterns for `sharded_state` and `runai_streamer_sharded`, effective\n"
"model configurations (including RoPE settings), and page layout. If the Hub revision\n"
"resolver is unavailable, pin the checkpoint commit when sharing a persistent\n"
"pool. Use a versioned directory when replacing local weights in a persistent\n"
"pool. Files overwritten in place keep the same model path."
msgstr ""
"HiSparse 使用的 AscendStore key 采用 `hisparse-ascendstore-v1` 命名空间。\n"
"该版本号标识外部 pool 的 key 格式。key 中包含\n"
"target 与 draft checkpoint 标识、解析后的 revision、dummy-weight 模式、\n"
"`sharded_state` 与 `runai_streamer_sharded` 的文件名模式、实际生效的\n"
"模型配置（包括 RoPE 设置）以及页布局。如果 Hub revision\n"
"解析器不可用，在共享持久化 pool 时请固定 checkpoint commit。\n"
"在持久化 pool 中替换本地权重时，请使用带版本号的目录。\n"
"原地覆盖的文件仍保持相同的模型路径。"

msgid "#### Monitoring AscendStore prefix reuse"
msgstr "#### 监控 AscendStore 前缀复用"

msgid ""
"Check the server's `/metrics` endpoint for\n"
"`vllm:external_prefix_cache_hits_total` to track prefix hits in MemCache and\n"
"`vllm:ascend_store_load_get_keys_total` to track keys read by AscendStore.\n"
"A request served from the local prefix cache may leave both counters unchanged."
msgstr ""
"查看服务器的 `/metrics` 端点，通过\n"
"`vllm:external_prefix_cache_hits_total` 跟踪 MemCache 中的前缀命中情况，通过\n"
"`vllm:ascend_store_load_get_keys_total` 跟踪 AscendStore 读取的 key 数量。\n"
"由本地前缀缓存直接服务的请求可能不会改变这两个计数器的值。"

msgid "| Parameter | Description |"
msgstr "| 参数 | 描述 |"

msgid "### AscendStore settings"
msgstr "### AscendStore 配置"

msgid ""
"| `kv_connector` / `kv_role` | In `--kv-transfer-config`, use "
"`MultiConnector` with one `HiSparseConnector` and one "
"`AscendStoreConnector`. Set `kv_role=kv_both` on the parent and both "
"children. |"
msgstr ""
"| `kv_connector` / `kv_role` | 在 `--kv-transfer-config` 中使用 "
"`MultiConnector`，其中包含一个 `HiSparseConnector` 和一个 "
"`AscendStoreConnector`。在父连接器及两个子连接器上均设置 `kv_role=kv_both`。 |"

msgid ""
"| `backend` / `load_async` | In the AscendStore child's "
"`kv_connector_extra_config`, set `backend=memcache` and `load_async=true`. |"
msgstr ""
"| `backend` / `load_async` | 在 AscendStore 子连接器的 `kv_connector_extra_config`"
" 中，设置 `backend=memcache` 和 `load_async=true`。 |"

msgid ""
"| `use_layerwise` / `discard_partial_chunks` | In the AscendStore child's "
"`kv_connector_extra_config`, keep `use_layerwise=false` and "
"`discard_partial_chunks=true` for whole-block transfers. |"
msgstr ""
"| `use_layerwise` / `discard_partial_chunks` | 在 AscendStore 子连接器的 "
"`kv_connector_extra_config` 中，保持 `use_layerwise=false` 和 "
"`discard_partial_chunks=true`，以实现整块传输。 |"

msgid ""
"| `protocol` | Set to `host_tcp` in the MemCache local configuration. |"
msgstr "| `protocol` | 在 MemCache 本地配置中设置为 `host_tcp`。 |"

msgid ""
"| `hisparse_config.eager_host_mirror` | Set to `true` in `--attention-"
"config`, including for Prefill-only saves. |"
msgstr ""
"| `hisparse_config.eager_host_mirror` | 在 `--attention-config` 中设置为 `true`，仅"
" Prefill 的保存场景也不例外。 |"

msgid "| `prefill_context_parallel_size` | Keep at `1`. |"
msgstr "| `prefill_context_parallel_size` | 保持为 `1`。 |"

msgid ""
"To fall back to local computation after an external load fails, set\n"
"`kv_load_failure_policy=recompute` in `--kv-transfer-config`."
msgstr ""
"若要在外部加载失败后回退到本地计算，请在 `--kv-transfer-config` 中设置\n"
"`kv_load_failure_policy=recompute`。"
